## Why This Is Asked
Tests memory ownership across Go and C, CGO boundaries, and concurrency with batch results.

## Key Concepts
- CGO string ownership and freeing
- Passing const char to C
- Interpreting out_n and freeing the memory allocated by malloc
- Worker pools and batch memory lifecycle

## Code Example
